<!doctype html><html lang="en-AU"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><title>HobbyNest · Shop preview</title><meta name="description" content="A first look at HobbyNest: 3D-printed products and downloadable STL designs. The shop is being prepared."/></head><body><a class="skip" href="#main"><span data-i18n="Skip to content">Skip to content</span></a><div class="preview-notice"><span data-i18n="Shop preview · Orders are not open yet">Shop preview · Orders are not open yet</span></div><header class="shop-header"><LanguagePicker/><a class="wordmark" href="/hobbynest" aria-label="HobbyNest home">Hobby<span>Nest</span><small>Ideas take shape here.</small></a><nav aria-label="HobbyNest navigation"><a href="#printed"><span data-i18n="Printed pieces">Printed pieces</span></a><a href="#files"><span data-i18n="STL designs">STL designs</span></a><a href="/contact"><span data-i18n="Get in touch">Get in touch</span></a></nav><a class="explore-link" href="/"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> <span data-i18n="Back to Explore by Claudia">Back to Explore by Claudia</span></a></header><main id="main"><section class="hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">3D printing · Digital designs</span><h1>A little space<br/>for big ideas.</h1><p>Meet HobbyNest: my home for 3D-printed products and designs you can make with your own printer.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#collections">Explore the collections ↓</a><a href="/contact">Say hello →</a></div></div><div class="nest-art" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 360 300" fill="none"><ellipse cx="180" cy="240" rx="128" ry="24" fill="#36594c" opacity=".08"/><path d="m180 48 100 58v116l-100 58-100-58V106Z" fill="#d9e4d9"/><path d="m80 106 100 58 100-58M180 164v116" stroke="#36594c" stroke-width="2"/>{[122,142,162,182,202,222].map(y=><path d={'M80 '+y+'l100 58 100-58'} stroke="#36594c" opacity=".25"/>)}<path d="m180 48 100 58-100 58-100-58Z" fill="#f5c6a9"/><path d="m130 106 50-29 50 29-50 29Z" fill="#fbf6ed"/><circle cx="286" cy="60" r="17" stroke="#a55134" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M286 49v22m-11-11h22" stroke="#a55134" stroke-width="2"/></svg><span>Designed digitally. Made tangible.</span></div></section><section id="collections" class="collections" aria-labelledby="collections-title"><div class="section-top"><h2 id="collections-title">Two ways to make it yours.</h2><span>Collections in preparation</span></div><div class="collection-grid"><article id="printed"><span class="number">01 · Made for you</span><h3><span data-i18n="Printed pieces">Printed pieces</span></h3><p>Physical 3D-printed products, with photographs, materials, dimensions and delivery details on each listing when the shop opens.</p><span class="status">Product collection coming soon</span></article><article id="files"><span class="number">02 · Make it yourself</span><h3>Downloadable STL designs</h3><p>Digital files for your own printer. Each listing will explain what’s included, printing guidance and the licence before you buy.</p><span class="status">Digital collection coming soon</span></article></div></section><section class="catalogue" aria-labelledby="catalogue-title"><h2 id="catalogue-title">The collection</h2><p>Browse published listings. Orders are not open yet. Dispatch estimates are separate from delivery time.</p><div id="nest-shop-filters" class="shop-filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter products"></div><p id="nest-shop-status" role="status">Loading collection…</p><div id="nest-shop-products" class="shop-products"></div></section><section class="shop-note"><h2>A small shop, taking shape.</h2><p>I’m preparing the first collection. Published listings are available to preview; no orders or payments are being collected here yet. For now, you can follow the making process through Explore or get in touch.</p><a href="/3d-printing">Projects & process →</a></section></main><footer><a class="wordmark" href="/hobbynest">Hobby<span>Nest</span></a><p>A business by Claudia, connected to Explore.</p><a href="/">Explore by Claudia</a><a href="/contact"><span data-i18n="Contact">Contact</span></a></footer></body></html>
<style is:global>
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:20px}body{margin:0;background:#fbf7ef;color:#263b31;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.6}a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:4px}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #a55134;outline-offset:5px}.skip{position:absolute;left:16px;top:-80px;padding:10px;background:#fff;z-index:3}.skip:focus{top:10px}.preview-notice{text-align:center;background:#36594c;color:#fff;font-size:12px;padding:7px 16px}.shop-header{max-width:1240px;margin:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:24px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid #d9ddd1}.wordmark{font:500 30px/1.1 Georgia,serif;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}.wordmark>span{color:#a55134}.wordmark small{display:block;font:10px/1.6 system-ui;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-top:5px}.shop-header nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 24px}.shop-header nav a,.explore-link{font-size:12px;min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;text-decoration:none}main{max-width:1184px;margin:auto;padding:0 28px 36px}.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:36px;align-items:center;padding:48px 0 36px}.eyebrow,.number{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em}.hero h1{font:450 clamp(40px,5vw,66px)/1.03 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:18px 0}.hero p{font-size:16px;max-width:43ch}.hero-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px 24px;margin-top:22px}.hero-actions a{font-size:13px;min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center}.button{padding:10px 18px;background:#36594c;color:#fff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none}.nest-art{max-width:350px;justify-self:center;text-align:center}.nest-art svg{width:100%;height:auto}.nest-art>span{font:italic 17px Georgia,serif;color:#6a725e}.section-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px}.section-top h2,.shop-note h2{font:450 29px/1.2 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 16px}.section-top>span{font-size:11px}.collection-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.collection-grid article{padding:24px;border:1px solid #d9ddd1;background:#fffdf8;border-radius:10px;min-width:0}.number{color:#a55134;font-size:10px}.collection-grid h3{font:450 28px/1.2 Georgia,serif;margin:12px 0}.collection-grid p,.shop-note p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.75}.status{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;padding:5px 9px;border:1px dashed #a9b7a8;border-radius:5px}.shop-note{margin-top:30px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid #d9ddd1;max-width:70ch}.shop-note a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;font-size:13px}footer{border-top:1px solid #d9ddd1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px 24px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:24px max(28px,calc((100vw - 1128px)/2));font-size:12px}footer .wordmark{font-size:24px}footer p{flex:1}footer>a:not(.wordmark){min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center}@media(max-width:800px){.shop-header{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}.shop-header nav{order:3;width:100%}.hero{gap:18px;padding-top:28px}.hero h1{font-size:46px}.hero p{font-size:14px}.collection-grid article{padding:18px}.section-top{display:block}.section-top>span{display:block;margin-bottom:12px}}@media(max-width:550px){.shop-header{padding:18px 20px}.wordmark{font-size:27px}.explore-link{font-size:11px}.shop-header nav{gap:8px 18px}.shop-header nav a{font-size:12px}main{padding-inline:20px}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-bottom:28px;gap:4px}.hero h1{font-size:43px}.nest-art{max-width:200px}.nest-art>span{font-size:14px}.collection-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.section-top h2{font-size:27px}.collection-grid h3{font-size:26px}footer{padding-inline:20px;gap:6px 18px}footer p{flex-basis:100%}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}@media(forced-colors:active){body,.preview-notice,.collection-grid article,.button{background:Canvas;color:CanvasText}.button,.status{border:1px solid CanvasText}.wordmark>span,.number{color:CanvasText}.nest-art{display:none}}
</style>

<style>.explore-link{gap:7px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #c5cec3;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500}.explore-link:hover{background:#edf1e8}@media(max-width:550px){.explore-link{flex-basis:100%;font-size:12px;justify-content:center}}@media(forced-colors:active){.explore-link{border-color:CanvasText}}</style>

<script>import '../scripts/hobbynest-shop.mjs';</script>
<style>.catalogue{margin-top:24px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #d9ddd1}.catalogue h2{font:450 29px Georgia,serif;margin:0}.catalogue>p{font-size:14px}.shop-filters{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.shop-filters :global(button){min-height:44px;padding:8px 12px;background:transparent;color:inherit;border:1px solid #b1bead;border-radius:6px;font:inherit;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer}.shop-filters :global([aria-pressed=true]){background:#36594c;color:white}.shop-products{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}.shop-products :global(article){min-width:0;border:1px solid #d9ddd1;border-radius:9px;padding:18px;background:#fffdf8;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.shop-products :global(h3){font:450 25px Georgia,serif;margin:8px 0}.shop-products :global(p){font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap}.shop-products :global(label){display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;font-size:13px}.shop-products :global(select){min-height:44px;max-width:100%;background:inherit;color:inherit;border:1px solid #b1bead;border-radius:5px;font:inherit;font-size:16px;padding:6px}.shop-products :global(.availability){font-weight:600;font-size:13px}.shop-products :global(details){font-size:13px}.shop-products :global(summary){cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center}.shop-products :global(small){font-size:12px}@media(max-width:900px){.shop-products{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:550px){.shop-products{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}}@media(forced-colors:active){.shop-filters :global([aria-pressed=true]){outline:2px solid Highlight}}</style>

<style>.shop-products :global(.product-photo){display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:contain;border-radius:5px;background:#f5f1e9}.shop-products :global(.product-thumbs){display:flex;gap:6px;overflow:auto;margin:8px 0 12px;padding:2px}.shop-products :global(.product-thumbs button){flex-shrink:0;min-width:48px;min-height:48px;padding:2px;border:1px solid #b1bead;background:transparent;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer}.shop-products :global(.product-thumbs img){display:block;width:44px;height:44px;object-fit:cover}.shop-products :global(.product-thumbs [aria-pressed=true]){outline:2px solid #36594c;outline-offset:1px}.shop-products :global(.product-gallery){margin-bottom:12px}</style>

<style is:global>.test-basket{margin:24px 0;padding:18px;border:1px solid #a9b7a8;border-radius:8px;background:#fffdf8}.test-basket h2{font:450 27px Georgia,serif;margin:0}.test-basket p{font-size:13px}.basket-form{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:end;flex-wrap:wrap}.test-basket label,.shop-products .test-product-controls label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;font-size:12px;min-width:0}.test-basket input,.test-basket select,.shop-products .test-product-controls input{min-height:44px;font:inherit;font-size:16px;border:1px solid #b1bead;border-radius:5px;padding:8px;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;background:inherit;color:inherit}.test-basket button,.shop-products .test-product-controls button{min-height:44px;font:inherit;font-size:13px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #36594c;border-radius:5px;color:inherit;background:transparent;cursor:pointer}.test-basket button:disabled,.shop-products .test-product-controls button:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:default}.basket-item{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d9ddd1}.basket-item>span{flex:1;min-width:120px}.basket-item input{width:80px}.shop-products .test-product-controls{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:end;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}.shop-products .test-product-controls input{width:80px}.shop-products .shop-channel-status{font-size:12px;border-left:2px solid #a55134;padding-left:8px}@media(max-width:550px){.basket-form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.basket-form input,.basket-form select{width:100%}}</style>
